  "title": "Retractable Technologies, Inc. Declares Dividends to Series II and III Class B Preferred Stock Shareholders",
  "summary": "LITTLE ELM, Texas – Retractable Technologies, Inc. (“Retractable”) (NYSE American: RVP) announced today that its Board of Directors has declared dividends to holders of its Series II Class B and Series III Class B Convertible Preferred Stock in the amounts of $39,050.00 and $18,561.25, respectively. Dividends have accrued at $1.00 per share per annum. The […]",
